{'symbol': 'HPE', 'date': '2023-04-04 13:00:00', 'title': 'HPE TRANSFORMS DATA LIFECYCLE MANAGEMENT WITH EXPANDED HPE ALLETRA PORTFOLIO WITH NEW FILE, BLOCK AND DATA PROTECTION SERVICES', 'text': 'HOUSTON--(BUSINESS WIRE)--HEWLETT PACKARD ENTERPRISE (NYSE: HPE) TODAY ANNOUNCED NEW FILE, BLOCK, DISASTER AND BACKUP RECOVERY DATA SERVICES DESIGNED TO HELP CUSTOMERS ELIMINATE DATA SILOS, REDUCE COST AND COMPLEXITY, AND IMPROVE PERFORMANCE. THE NEW FILE STORAGE DATA SERVICES DELIVER SCALE-OUT, ENTERPRISE-GRADE PERFORMANCE FOR DATA-INTENSIVE WORKLOADS, AND THE EXPANDED BLOCK SERVICES PROVIDE MISSION-CRITICAL STORAGE WITH MID-RANGE ECONOMICS.'}